# 🛑 Cost Safety Rules

| Rule                | Why                 |
| ------------------- | ------------------- |
| Use `Standard_B1s`  | Cheapest VM         |
| Stop VMs when idle  | Save compute cost   |
| Delete Public IPs   | Avoid IP charges    |
| Delete RG after lab | Avoid surprise bill |

Check usage anytime:

```bash
az consumption usage list --top 5
```

